 "markdown": "**Ashtakavarga chart** (South Indian style, printed page 224)\n\n```\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         | 0000        | 000         | 000         |\n|             |             |             | 000         |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         |                           | 00000       |\n| 000         |                           |             |\n+-------------+                           +-------------+\n| 0000        |                           | L           |\n|             |                           | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         | 0000        | 00000       | 0000        |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n```\n\nLagna is in Leo, so houses are counted from there.\n\n| House | Sign | Bindus |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 (Lagna) | Leo | 5 |\n| 2 | Virgo | 4 |\n| 3 | Libra | 5 |\n| 4 | Scorpio | 4 |\n| 5 | Sagittarius | 3 |\n| 6 | Capricorn | 4 |\n| 7 | Aquarius | 6 |\n| 8 | Pisces | 3 |\n| 9 | Aries | 4 |\n| 10 | Taurus | 3 |\n| 11 | Gemini | 6 |\n| 12 | Cancer | 5 |\n\nTotal bindus: **52** — the standard total for Venus.\n\n**Ashtakavarga chart** (South Indian style, printed page 224)\n\n```\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 00          | 00          | 0000        | 000         |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         |                           |             |\n+-------------+                           +-------------+\n| 000         |                           | L 00        |\n|             |                           | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n|             | 000         | 0000        | 000         |\n|             |             |             | 000         |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n```\n\n| Sign | Bindus |\n|---|---|\n| Aries | 2 |\n| Taurus | 4 |\n| Gemini | 3 |\n| Leo | 7 |\n| Virgo | 6 |\n| Libra | 4 |\n| Scorpio | 3 |\n| Capricorn | 3 |\n| Aquarius | 3 |\n| Pisces | 2 |\n\nTotal bindus: **37** — this matches no standard planetary ashtakavarga total (48 Sun, 49 Moon/Lagna, 39 Mars/Saturn, 54 Mercury, 56 Jupiter, 52 Venus, 337 sarva), so it needs checking by eye.",
